    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0303" n="131" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg131"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 300.115L98/2</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Rome</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Tredwell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-13T21:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 13, 1917, 9 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 14, 1 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>British Consul, Cagliari, Sardinia, reports: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Captain McDonough and nine men, crew ex-American
                            sailor [<hi rendition="#italic">schooner</hi>] <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lyman M. Law</hi>, New York, reported destroyed by submarine
                            yesterday morning, have just landed here. Master begs you for
                            assistance.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">Pernis, British Consul</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Am making investigation. May leave for Cagliari to-morrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tredwell</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
